    "speed_semantics": "speed is engine speed; travel_speed=speed−gravity_speed, before optional empty-fuel half-motion. Values are original game units; physical metres are not calibrated.",
    "resource_ownership": "boost_energy is thermal/burn capacity fraction, not EP/SP/HP. Fuel is supplied externally; model does not invent fuel consumption/regeneration or character vital capacity. Combat owns HP/shield/ammo/death."
  },
  "adaptations": [
    "Stable120Hz source Euler clock with remainder; individual frame delta capped at0.5seconds. Source used variable frame dt, so this is a deterministic numerical adaptation, not byte-equivalent legacy timing.",
    "Keyboard W/S supplies normalized vertical cursor axis; Q/E horizontal cursor axis. Existing A/D roll key name supplies original lateral thrust, not a simulated aerodynamic bank-turn force.",
    "Original source converts mouse horizontal/vertical input and visual bank separately. No invented roll-to-centripetal-flight formula is added.",
    "Startup position and initially full burn/fuel-available session are local setup. Engine choices are explicit original level-one ITEM records, not evidence of historical character equipment.",
    "GEAR switches preserve live pose/speed/thermal fraction for local preview; original inventory/equipment authorization is absent.",
    "Ground contact orientation is supplied directly by the new WorldModel. Landing/takeoff are instant local bridges; takeoff adds5game units clearance instead of playing original server/cinematic movement patterns.",
    "Ground siege stops A-GEAR translation only. Original skill availability, firing arcs and damage modifiers belong to combat/skills and are not invented here.",
    "Generic world sweep collision response is a local adapter. The original aircraft multi-ray body queries, slide modes, landing avoidance and damage routing are not fully ported."
  ],
  "unimplemented_original_states": [
    "Hyperbooster and skill/enchantment/formation/joystick modifiers",
    "Server-authorized rolling dodge and its body-condition animation/invulnerability states",
    "Full takeoff/landing cinematic patterns, warp/observer/formation, robot armor and atmospheric/space special states",
    "Original fuel-empty falling/death/cinematic state machine; current core exposes fuel gating and half-motion only",
    "Original ground multi-point suspension/body rays and complete A-GEAR siege skills"
  ],
